abstract: A pre-registered benchmark that asks what a project had decided as of a given date, with gold taken from the git history of the PEP, EIP and ERC decision records. Two licences apply. The dataset, the files in data/v0.1, the published results and every file published beside the results report, the label files included, are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (LICENSE-DATA in the repository, the licence named above); the code that generates and scores it, and the documents, are released under the MIT licence (LICENSE in the repository).
keywords: [benchmark, llm-evaluation, agent-memory, rag, knowledge-graph, temporal-reasoning, long-context, preregistration]
